<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SAVINGS BANKS' 1996 OP PROFIT UP 38 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SAVINGS BANKS' 1996 OP PROFIT UP 38 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 231 vs 167</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	 797 vs 755</p>
<p> Credit losses					101 vs 105</p>
<p> Write-offs					    17 vs 3</p>
<p> Capital adequacy, percent		     14.2 vs 13.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures above include all 40 Finnish savings</p>
<p>banks including Aktia Bank.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
